f.wiki/Character_Skins#/media/File:310001_sw_1_01_job_change.png\n唯一の違いは、ドレスが白と紫であることと、剣の代わりにこのような槍を持っていることです： https://gbf.wiki/Spear_of_Eternal_Splendor#/media/File:Weapon_b_1040214700.png\n\nポーズは https://gbf.wiki/Athena#/media/File:Npc_zoom_3040202000_01.png\n\nポーズはお尻、太もも、お尻を強調してください。\n\nご検討ありがとうございました！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 262723, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "tatinami", "screen_name": "tatinami666", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1655187620249632768/KtmcU2X5.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/997105538524590080/1633953865/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 324486, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "おやずり@Skeb募集中", "screen_name": "Oyazuly", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013431034293911552/sWRxje9s.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1194837809887993856/1768874342/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 80, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 599422, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "96sabi@Skeb&VGenOpen", "screen_name": "kinakoyamamori", "avatar_url": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:6jorysndiusj7xaiecoaghbg/bafkreifatkz7bpylcb5i7nq5f47apcfcbbtijfqxhw4brig6orup7soura", "header_url": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/banner/plain/did:plc:6jorysndiusj7x